#: inc/template-tags.php:22
msgid "Is the grass real?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/template-tags.php:22
msgid "Yes. This is our most common question and, frankly, the most insulting. It is real grass, grown in a real greenhouse, by people with dirt under their nails."
msgstr ""

#: inc/template-tags.php:23
msgid "How often do I water it?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/template-tags.php:23
msgid "A light mist every two to three days. The Mister exists for exactly this ritual."
msgstr ""

#: inc/template-tags.php:24
msgid "Will it survive my apartment?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/template-tags.php:24
msgid "If you survive your apartment, the grass will. It asks less of you than your houseplants did."
msgstr ""

#: inc/template-tags.php:25
msgid "How fast is shipping?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/template-tags.php:25
msgid "Orders leave the greenhouse within 48 hours. The grass travels better than you do."
msgstr ""

#: inc/template-tags.php:26
msgid "What if my grass dies?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/template-tags.php:26
msgid "Then it lived a short, beautiful, indoor life. The 30-day regrow guarantee means a replacement ships free. No interrogation."
msgstr ""

#: inc/template-tags.php:27
msgid "Isn't going outside free?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/template-tags.php:27
msgid "Yes. And yet here you are. We're not judging. We're invoicing."
msgstr ""

#: inc/template-tags.php:28
msgid "Is this a joke?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/template-tags.php:28
msgid "The grass is real. The price is real. Your refusal to go outside is real. Which part sounds like a joke?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/template-tags.php:65
msgid "\"I bought it as a joke for our hackathon team. It is now the most important object in the office. Our standups are 40% calmer.\""
